<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>Categories | HeartCode Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="categories">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'categories' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Content</p>
        <h1>Categories</h1>
        <p>An organizational layer above website types, e.g. &ldquo;Birthday,&rdquo; &ldquo;Valentine's&rdquo;, so <code>/explore</code> can group types into cards instead of one long list.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="admin-callout">
      A website type with no category assigned still appears on <code>/explore</code>, in a separate &ldquo;More Website Types&rdquo; section. Nothing disappears just because it isn't categorized yet.
      If you have zero active categories, <code>/explore</code> shows the original flat list, exactly as before.
    </div>

    <section class="admin-split-grid">
      <div class="admin-card admin-sticky-card">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Create</p><h2>Add category</h2></div></div>
        <form id="addCategoryForm">
          <label class="admin-label" for="categoryName">Name</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="name" id="categoryName" required placeholder="e.g. Birthday">
          <label class="admin-label" for="categorySlug">Slug (optional, auto-generated from name if left blank)</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="slug" id="categorySlug">
          <label class="admin-label" for="categoryDescription">Description</label>
          <textarea class="admin-textarea" name="description" id="categoryDescription" placeholder="Shown on the category card"></textarea>
          <label class="admin-label" for="categoryIconName">Icon</label>
          <select class="admin-select" name="iconName" id="categoryIconName">
            <% iconNames.forEach(function (name) { %><option value="<%= name %>"><%= name %></option><% }); %>
          </select>
          <div class="admin-form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="admin-btn">Add category</button>
            <p id="addCategoryStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="admin-list-panel">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Display order</p><h2>Categories</h2></div></div>
        <div id="categoriesList" class="admin-entry-list"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
